abstract: "A quantitative backtesting framework that evaluates the efficacy of applying geometric angle thresholds to Exponential Moving Average crossovers. The engine tests 1,440 parameter combinations to mathematically demonstrate that vector-based momentum filters improve trend-following win rates in financial markets."
